{"title": "White Lance", "pageid": 2054, "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>White Lance</b> is <a href=\"/wiki/Pavel\" title=\"Pavel\">Pavel's</a> sword, also known as the Night Blade. White Lance is inscribed with portions of the <a href=\"/wiki/The_Pattern\" title=\"The Pattern\">Pattern</a> of <a href=\"/wiki/Yander\" title=\"Yander\">Yander</a> and was forged on the steps of <a href=\"/wiki/Tir-na_Nog%27th\" title=\"Tir-na Nog&#39;th\">Notr Na'th</a>; this makes it particularly effective against creatures of Tumba. In addition, White Lance has one magical property that makes it particularly useful: Pavel can call it by creating a <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow\" title=\"Shadow\">Shadow</a> where he wills it to exist. Unlike a normal blade, White Lance can also harm apparitions, and allows Pavel to speak to the shades in <a href=\"/wiki/Tir-na_Nog%27th\" title=\"Tir-na Nog&#39;th\">Notr Na'th</a>.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<dl><dd><div class=\"notice metadata plainlinks\" id=\"stub\"><i>This article is a <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Article_stubs\" title=\"Category:Article stubs\">stub</a>. You can help Amberpedia Wiki by  <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://princeofamber.fandom.com/wiki/White Lance?action=edit\">expanding it</a>.</i></div></dd></dl>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260430183442\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.009 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.014 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 8/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 336/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    1.989      1 Template:Stub\n100.00%    1.989      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43